  message: "Merged in PR #1441 (dev b130f1c054).\n\nFixed in PR #1441. annotation_convention labels the id slot and `discovery_language` with `taxonomy.get_language`.\n- Behaviour: the fixture survey before gave `tsx:m5.tsx:…` (discovery_language `tsx`) and `unknown:m6.mts:…` / `unknown:m7.cts:…` (None). After, all three read `typescript`. The test asserts every directive kind (route, publisher, subscriber, dispatcher) in all 8 extensions carries the analyzer's tag.\n- Gate: `language_from_path` callers are pinned and shrink-only, with annotation_convention excluded.\n- Residual label users (phoenix_ipc `.ex` → None, openapi spec files → None) are filed as WI-zahom.\n- No corpus incidence: `@hg:` is opt-in, and there were 0 directives in the 2 measured repos."  # 78e2
